{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letter by letter, word by word, sentence by sentence -\u00a0the work of a cryptographer is far from easy.\u00a0Luckily, we have you, our talented codebreaker!\u00a0Take your place at the machine and confront diverse, highly intriguing encrypted messages, all requiring sharp thinking and cleverness to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/f4451fa7a54b8048b621c213dc32b608.webp?t=1759110897\" width=780 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/48bfe76249ec055ce5d49ee6569d5af1.poster.avif?t=1759110897\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/48bfe76249ec055ce5d49ee6569d5af1.webm?t=1759110897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/48bfe76249ec055ce5d49ee6569d5af1.mp4?t=1759110897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step by Step</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, each message will seem like incomprehensible gibberish -\u00a0convoluted, seemingly meaningless.\u00a0However, nothing could be further from the truth!\u00a0By deciphering subsequent letters and words, you will quickly find a pattern that will allow you to decipher the entire message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/fd6b1691d49b4e924d9a6bba38e08fd3.webp?t=1759110897\" width=780 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/05d05e6996b704a1804e8b809674d6f5.poster.avif?t=1759110897\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/05d05e6996b704a1804e8b809674d6f5.webm?t=1759110897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/05d05e6996b704a1804e8b809674d6f5.mp4?t=1759110897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So much to discover!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncovering a variety of quotes rich in humor, wisdom, or insight\u00a0can be challenging, yet with 100 levels to complete you are sure to have enough room to hone your skills and become the true expert.\u00a0Each new message grants a sense of satisfaction and\u00a0an insight into the wisdom of the brightest people in history!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/3bcfa2b9f2242512d5f2530c8cddb4d6.webp?t=1759110897\" width=780 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/bd04e1cd926e4128480e678ab9fc0867.poster.avif?t=1759110897\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/bd04e1cd926e4128480e678ab9fc0867.webm?t=1759110897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/bd04e1cd926e4128480e678ab9fc0867.mp4?t=1759110897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nearly endless content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decoding journey can continue\u00a0almost endlessly,\u00a0with Cipheur offering a rich supply of extra coded message packs. Test your wits against sets like Last Words, Proverbs, Stupid Laws, Uncommon Words and many more! All this wrapped in a pleasant, simple and concentration-friendly visual layout to help you work and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469820/extras/b838f24864d5024587f08511a0c4739b.webp?t=1759110897\" width=780 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 100 quotes by famous people - fun, witty or insightful - we have them all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 3 difficulty levels to allow you move forward in your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Helpful hints system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Numerous achievements to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 An unusual gameplay focused solely on deciphering coded messages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cipheur I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469820/5bb52fd86f1da0326e1a76496bfa6404be27d50c.jpg"},{"name":"Cipheur II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469820/2a240ca0cb31a40729ef5ffbcc9d1ad4ba64c23f.jpg"},{"name":"Cipheur III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469820/91aad90010b4dd0c19928ff8a061eb131bd21708.jpg"},{"name":"Cipheur IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469820/9f17c26d84cafdb687efd3b0ef657b738b5ff8a7.jpg"},{"name":"Cipheur V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469820/3